    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs7fkGvU",
      "title": "Add new standard versions entries for op-contracts/v7.0.0-rc.4",
      "author": "maurelian",
      "number": 1245,
      "body": "Adds `[\"op-contracts/v7.0.0-rc.4\"]` entries to both `standard-versions-mainnet.toml` and `standard-versions-sepolia.toml`.\r\n\r\nContracts have not been redeployed since [v7.0.0-rc.3](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism/releases/tag/op-contracts%2Fv7.0.0-rc.3): the only change between\r\nrc.3 and rc.4 is in `packages/contracts-bedrock/scripts/deploy/DeployOPChain.s.sol` (a deploy-time script that scales `ResourceConfig` for smaller gas limits — see optimism#20925). No `src/`, `semver-lock.json`, or snapshot changes. Therefore the new entries reuse the same implementation addresses as rc.3.\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-26T20:27:35Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-05-26T20:34:59Z",
      "additions": 42,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs7fkRlR",
      "title": "Add karst (U19) activation timestamps for Sepolia + Mainnet",
      "author": "sbvegan",
      "number": 1246,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd the Karst (U19) hardfork activation timestamps for the Sepolia and Mainnet superchains plus all participating chain configs:\n\n| Network | Date (UTC) | Unix timestamp |\n|---|---|---|\n| Sepolia | Wed 17 Jun 2026 16:00:01 UTC | 1781712001 |\n| Mainnet | Wed  8 Jul 2026 16:00:01 UTC | 1783526401 |\n\nBoth follow the recent `:01` second offset convention (jovian, isthmus, holocene) — guarantees any block landing exactly at 16:00:00 is the final block of the prior fork, with the transition at the next block.\n\n## Files changed\n\n- `superchain/configs/mainnet/superchain.toml`\n- `superchain/configs/sepolia/superchain.toml`\n- Mainnet chain configs: `op`, `ink`, `metal`, `mode`, `soneium`, `unichain`, `zora`\n- Sepolia chain configs: `op`, `ink`, `metal`, `mode`, `soneium-minato`, `unichain`, `zora`\n\nAll 14 chains track the superchain default — no per-chain overrides.\n\n## Context\n\nTimestamps were locked in [ethereum-optimism/solutions#668](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/solutions/issues/668) on 2026-05-23.\n\nThis PR covers only the activation timestamps. OPCM addresses, contract implementations, and the Karst kona absolute prestate hash will land in follow-up PRs as those artifacts become available:\n- Post-audit OPCM deploy → tracked in ethereum-optimism/solutions#441\n- Kona absolute prestate review → tracked in ethereum-optimism/solutions#697\n\n## Note for reviewers\n\nIf the SCR `Hardforks` struct (`ops/internal/config/chain.go`) and validation wiring don't yet recognize `karst_time`, that wiring needs to land first (or alongside this PR). Upstream support exists in op-geth + op-node (`KarstTime` field in `rollup.Config`); this is just the SCR plumbing.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-26T20:35:20Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-05-26T21:27:59Z",
      "additions": 26,
      "deletions": 0
    },
